<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZILIAN SOCCER RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZILIAN SOCCER RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Brazilian</p>
<p>soccer matches played at the weekend:</p>
<p>Brazilian championship</p>
<p> America/Natal	    1    Criciuma		     1</p>
<p> Atletico Paranaense    2    Uniao Sao Joao	     0</p>
<p> Bragantino		 3    Bahia			  1</p>
<p> Corinthians		1    Internacional		3</p>
<p> Cruzeiro		   3    Guarani			1</p>
<p> Flamengo		   2    Santos			 3</p>
<p> Juventude		  0    Goias			  0</p>
<p> Palmeiras		  4    Fluminense		   1</p>
<p> Portuguesa		 1    Coritiba		     0</p>
<p>Rio de Janeiro championship, final play-off</p>
<p> Vasco da Gama	    1    Botafogo		     0</p>
<p>Botafogo 4 points, Vasco da Gama 3. First team to six</p>
<p>points wins the title. Botafogo were given a four-point start</p>
<p>by virtue of winning two of the three preliminary stages.</p>
<p>Second match: July 8.</p>
